%% render: auto
%% title: Animation-ready character production
%% desc: Deformation drives every decision. Each arrow names the versioned asset the next step consumes.
flowchart TD
    A["Character reference • approved turnaround or images"]:::slate
    B["Image-to-3D or manual modelling • raw geometry v1"]:::amber
    C["Deformation-aware topology • loops at joints, Blender retopo"]:::amber
    D["UVs and materials • unwrap, bake, PBR"]:::amber
    E["UniRig • predicted skeleton and skin"]:::amber
    F["Blender correction • joints, roll, weights"]:::amber
    G["Test poses • limits, penetration, volume"]:::blue
    H["Animation • keyframes or retargeted clips"]:::teal
    I["Validated rig export • FBX and GLB plus reports"]:::green
    A --> B
    B -->|OBJ or GLB v1| C
    C -->|retopo mesh v2| D
    D -->|textured v3| E
    E -->|FBX rig v4| F
    F --> G
    G -.->|fails| F
    G -->|passes| H
    H -->|animated v5| I
